cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LNU BLIS Platform: Mock Librarians' Licensure Examination and Review System"
abstract: >-
  A web platform for the Bachelor of Library and Information Science (BLIS)
  programme of Leyte Normal University. Students take timed mock board
  examinations and practise their weak topics; teachers build examinations from
  their own question sets and follow each class; a logistic regression model
  estimates each student's chance of passing the Librarians' Licensure
  Examination (LLE) from their mock board scores.
